      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُمْتَلَخُ العَقْلِ</span></b>  (tropical:)  A man <i>deprived,</i> or <i>despoiled of
his reason.</i> (S, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الصُّلْبِ</span> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُتَمَلِّخِ</span></b>  A man
<i>weakened,</i> or <i>enervated, in the back-bone,</i> or <i>back;</i>
(K;) as though it were pulled asunder. (TA.)

